<p class="kicker">2024-08-11 · go · ssg</p>
<h1>Writing a static site generator in Go</h1>
<p><a href="https://github.com/HimanshuSardana/kite">kite</a> is my minimal, blazingly fast SSG: Markdown in, HTML out. No JS bundler, no 900 deps.</p>
<h2>Design</h2>
<ul><li>Frontmatter + Markdown → <code>html/template</code></li><li>Incremental rebuilds via mtime cache</li><li>Single binary, <code>kite build</code> and <code>kite serve</code></li></ul>
<pre><code>$ kite build
✓ 42 pages in 18ms</code></pre>
<p>It also powers <a href="https://github.com/HimanshuSardana/bonsai">bonsai</a>, my minimal git frontend. This portfolio itself is Astro — right tool per job.</p>
